hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"10","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Apne gharon ko qabaristan na banao. Beshak shaitan us ghar se bhagta hai jis mein Surah Al-Baqarah parhi jati hai."
"11","[AI-translation] Ubay bin Ka'b kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ayya Al-Mundhir! Kya tum jaante ho Allah ki kitab ki kaun si aayat tumhare paas sab se azeem hai? Maine kaha: Allah aur Uske Rasool behtar jaante hain. Farmaya: Ayya Al-Mundhir! Kya tum jaante ho Allah ki kitab ki kaun si aayat tumhare paas sab se azeem hai? Maine kaha: ""Allahu la ilaha illa huwal hayyul qayyum."" Toh aap ne mere seene par haath maara aur farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Tumhein ilm mubarak ho, Ayya Al-Mundhir."
"12","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe Ramzan ki zakaat ki hifazat par muqarrar farmaya. Toh mere paas ek shakhs aaya aur khane uthane laga. Maine use pakad liya aur kaha: Main tujhe zaroor Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le jaunga. Pura qissa bayan kiya gaya toh farmaya: Jab tu apne bistar par jaaye toh Aayatul Kursi parh. Allah ki taraf se tere paas ek hifazat karne wala rahega aur subah ho tak tujh se koi shaitan qareeb nahi aayega. Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Usne tujh se sach kaha, halanki woh jhoota hai, woh shaitan hai."
